---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-rule bg-cream">
  <div class="container-page py-14">
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex no-underline" aria-label="XCap Factoring home">
          <Logo class="block h-10 w-auto" />
        </a>
        <p class="body-copy mt-4 max-w-md text-inksoft">
          We read factoring contracts for the businesses that signed them. Free audit, your true
          effective rate, and a straight answer on whether better terms exist for you.
        </p>
      </div>
      <nav class="flex flex-col gap-2 md:items-end" aria-label="Footer">
        <a href="/" class="nav-link w-fit">Home</a>
        <a href="/audit" class="nav-link w-fit">Free contract audit</a>
        <a href="/privacy" class="nav-link w-fit">Privacy</a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 border-t border-rule pt-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 font-mono text-[0.72rem] leading-relaxed text-inksoft">
        <p>
          XCap Factoring is a commercial finance broker, not a factor and not a lender. We audit
          factoring agreements, compare terms, and place businesses with factoring companies in our
          network. We do not fund invoices ourselves.
        </p>
        <p>
          Audit results are automated estimates based on the document you provide and are subject
          to human confirmation. They are not a binding quote, not legal advice, and not accounting
          or tax advice. Consult an attorney before terminating or signing any agreement.
        </p>
        <p>
          {/* DBA wording pending Przemek confirmation (Phase 0). Best-known form below. */}
          XCap Factoring, a DBA of XCap Funding. &copy; {year} All rights reserved.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
